# Why ATT&CK Matters

Mapping detections to ATT&CK provides several benefits.

### Standardized Communication

Analysts, engineers, and management can describe attacker behavior consistently.

### Detection Coverage

Organizations can identify which attacker techniques are monitored and which require additional detections.

### Threat Hunting

ATT&CK techniques provide starting points for proactive hunting.

### Incident Investigation

Analysts can understand where an attacker is within the attack lifecycle.

### Reporting

Executives and auditors can measure defensive maturity using ATT&CK coverage.

