# Lab Implementation

During this project:

- Authentication telemetry was analyzed using KQL.
- SSH brute-force behavior was identified.
- Detection logic was mapped to **T1110 – Brute Force**.
- Investigation findings were documented using ATT&CK terminology.
- Recommendations included enhancing detections and monitoring for successful authentication attempts that could indicate progression to additional ATT&CK techniques.

This exercise demonstrated how ATT&CK provides a structured method for describing attacker behavior and improving future detections.

