# Key Takeaways

- MITRE ATT&CK is a behavior-based framework for understanding adversary techniques.
- Tactics describe attacker objectives, while techniques describe how those objectives are achieved.
- Microsoft Sentinel supports ATT&CK mappings within Analytics Rules and incidents.
- Accurate mappings improve investigations, reporting, and detection engineering.
- ATT&CK should be used to describe observed behavior, not assumed attacker actions.

